Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeenth Episode\NThe Greedy Ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a truly\Nterrible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The deceased owner\Nof the house...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...was very miserly,\Ndespite being rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and treated the poor terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And is it true what they say: that now\Nthere is a ghost living in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! It seems that it is\Nthe owner herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...who continues to haunt\Nthe house as a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- And do you believe it?\N- Many people believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Where do you want to go, Your Highness?\NIt's already dark outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, today's lesson\Nis not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you will do it.\NMake sure you study hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry..\NHey, but I am the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then teach yourself! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you leaving? - I'm going to play\Nin the ghost's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I forbid you\Nto leave the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Prince!\NDon't go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him! Stop\NPrince Sapphire, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to the ghost's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ghost's house\Nthat everyone is talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one!\NFollow him immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Do I have to go\Ninto that house too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? You often asked\Nto borrow money...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...from the owner,\Nbefore she died,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so you are a client\Nof the ghost, let's say! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, so much fog!\NI can barely see anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go slower
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It went out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you? Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be a scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me: I am not afraid\Nat all, even if I am a girl! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get angry?\NGood! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back home, Opal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spend a night here. Do\Nyou think the ghost will hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning you will\Ncome pick me up. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest easy,\NI don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NGo home, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, see you tomorrow!\NBye, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a terrible hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible\Nto cross this swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this way I have a good\Nexcuse to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I must consider myself\Nlucky. Let's head right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! I'm drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! I didn't know it was\Nso shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ghost! Show\Nyourself, if you're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly\Na supernatural event!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, so many books!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a set table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is a surprise!\NI'll taste this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, it seems to\Nme that the bottle is moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's made\Nof mud and clay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's good anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! This is even\Ntoo much kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, though..! How come\Nthe ghost treats me so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your magic! Why\Ndon't you show yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the portrait of the\Nowner. What a beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're quite the flatterer!\N- Are you the ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's right, my handsome.\N- You are older than the portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I was much younger there.\N- But I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought ghosts\Nhad a horrible appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually that's the case\Nand it could be my case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't feel like looking\Nlike an old witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,..and I take care of my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but why\Nare you treating me so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that in life\Nyou were very stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead and say it.\NWhat does it matter now, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the stingiest and greediest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is why\NI cannot rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even after my death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse,\NI cannot go to Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give yourself a push\Nand go up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, that's how you go to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You whistle, the car arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...and if you can go there,\Nit takes you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have never been picked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven is calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can go up to Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.\NThe problem is not solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange light this is..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, I'll hold the light\Nfor you, so you can climb up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- There, now climb!\N- Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt yourself,\NPrince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!\NClimb as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, they don't\Nwant to let you reach Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much for me!\NI can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am desperate\Nand I even want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is that you cannot\Ndie twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I had forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help you,\Nbut I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it! Tell me, were there many\Npeople at your funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't have a funeral.\N- That's exactly the point:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the funeral! We will need\Na large number of people...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...to attend! How many\Npeople were closest to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I had three dear friends,\Nwhom I had known for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that will be enough! I'm going to fetch them!\NTell me where they live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you think\Nthat the funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...will allow me\Nto go to Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Because everyone weeps for the deceased\Nduring the funeral service.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that anyone\Ncan go to Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,.if people weep for him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I have been\Ntoo wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Forgive me!\NI didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are their addresses
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this one here...\NThis one here and this other one here..!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will ask them to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink this cordial\Nand do not be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You will remember that I lent you\Nsome money. Did you bring it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But... is she still talking about\Nmoney even though she's a ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a ghost remembers\Nthe money she lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! If I keep going like\Nthis, I will never go to Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure that\Nyou can go to Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,..if someone cries for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You eavesdropped, didn't\Nyou? How indiscreet you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, what would\Nyou say if I cried for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man, if you are really\Nso kind, then please do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to\Nclear your debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I need another favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to borrow\Nmore money from me again, I hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am.\NIt's about Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What does\NPrince Sapphire have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like you to find proof\Nthat the Prince is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see...\NThis is the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Did you borrow\Nsome money from Mrs. Shannerock?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this is a stable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, what a scare!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened, Sapphire?\N- Tink, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I'm here?\NI'm looking for three people who..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...can weep for the death\Nof a certain old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see,\Nthen I can help you too
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you want me to do?\N- You go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! We have to help a poor\Nold lady! Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever borrowed money\Nfrom Mrs. Shannerock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked her for a penny, but I've\Nalready returned it. Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you wake me up, little one?\NI was sleeping so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mrs. Shannerock...\N- She lent me a nickel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and died before I\Ncould return it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come with me! Right now!\N- What a rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cry for her, she\Nwill cancel your debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- What do you want from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down! Put me\Ndown, I said! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse him. Did\Nyou know Mrs. Shannerock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew her, and her greed\Nalways made me feel very sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you cry for her? Be kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me to cry for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!\NI'll be happy to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...to this sort of funeral\Nwhenever you want, even right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an excellent idea on your part!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You could cry for her, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, why should we\Ncry for that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible! When she was alive, she didn't\Neven give us a piece of bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You mangy old man! You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm full.\NI'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cry a little for her,\Nbefore you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I force myself,\Ncan't you see I can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't pay her back\Nsome money she lent me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so she took my house, my\Nhorse, and everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to cry for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! I'm afraid\Nthat no one will want to cry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At least you, who were her maid,\Nwill try to cry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't! She made me\Nwork without paying me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she didn't give me enough\Nto eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder a person\Nlike that is rejected by Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She deserves\Nto stay on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mean! They are all mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too much for me,\Neven if I am a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I like money, it's true, but\Nwhat's wrong with loving money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! You too!\N- It's a hopeless endeavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, maybe it's better if we leave
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Prince! Please, stay\Nwith me! Don't go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't leave her like this.\N- Do you want to go back, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Even Opal\Nagrees with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to the city\Nwith Opal, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Watch out for the ghost.\N- Go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas! I am a lonely\Nand miserable ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing\Nto cry for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you do me the favor\NI asked of you some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do I get proof\Nthat the Prince is a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah, there he is coming back!\N- I expected it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am counting on you!\NI am hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Prince!\NI am glad you have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you\Nfor your kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, make yourself comfortable in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Follow me, Prince. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look inside this wardrobe,\NPrince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope there are\Nsome clothes that you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are all women's clothes!\NI am a boy! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So I know for sure whether\Nyou are a girl or a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not elegant enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, stop!\N- The mirror is at the end of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome! I didn't expect to\Nsee you here, Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For a Princess who\Npretends to be a Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...there is the death penalty in this kingdom!\N- What? The death penalty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Which do you prefer?\NDecapitation or hanging?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot send\Nsuch a good person to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is decreed\Nby the law of Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,against which\Nnothing can be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Princess?\NI will take you to Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care at all\Nabout this damn law!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't find it reasonable to send\Nsuch a good person to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Prince Sapphire!\NThis man is very wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He took advantage of my good\Nfaith for his dirty schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems my big mouth\Nwoke him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I bumped into!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go then, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess? And where is she?\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are a girl! I made\Nsure of it with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? Then why don't you\Nmake sure of it once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, you saw it too\Nthat she is a girl! Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- No!\N- Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even this lady says... What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I assure you that Prince\NSapphire is without a doubt a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's impossible!\NLook at the clothes in the wardro..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NHe was looking at himself in the mirr..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned old hag! You'll\Npay for your betrayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will forbid everyone\Nfrom coming to this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means? That\Nno one will come to weep for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so you will remain a ghost forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- No! Nylon!\N- So, what is Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's... it's... it's...\Nit's really a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it? It\Nwas a good opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Prince.\NReally, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's that light again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the road to Heaven,\Nma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to climb up.\NThank you, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that this time,\Ntoo, you didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, I hate Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the other world\Ndivided into Hell and Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! That is a\Nghost! Set fire to the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let everything burn!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to set the\Nhouse on fire?! I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Shannerock!\NSoldiers, keep setting the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see? Evil\Nwill strike your men...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...if they continue to\Nset fire to the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to her!\NKeep burning it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Nylon! This is\Nan order from the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you are not a Prince! Your\NHighness, you have given yourself away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a girl! Quick,\Narrest Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then I will stop them!\NYou, madam, put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shannerock will end up\Nbeing a ghost without a home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! It's\Ndangerous to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am! Let's get out\Nof here quickly! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my home, Prince.\NI am too tired to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get out\Nof here! I will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry to have disturbed you, but\Nby now I have given up on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Even on going to Heaven?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:23:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But now get out of here quickly! In\Na little while this house will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful! Nylon\Nis trying to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You worry about me...\Nat a moment like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, I\Nbeg you! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.86,0:23:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet of you to worry so\Nmuch about me! I am so moved by it...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! The fire has\Nstopped burning! How is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.74,0:23:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, now\NI can go to Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,since you have shed\Ntears for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, leave this house now\Nthat the fire is not burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.38,0:23:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Prince's ghost!\N- Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.58,0:23:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, I am overjoyed\Nthat you were saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.18,0:23:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, excuse me, what\Nhappened to the ghost of Shannerock?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.06,0:23:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Mrs. Shannerock\Nis going up to Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:37.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
